WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The MLLM receives multiple views of one room.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
Image patches become image tokens, grouped by view.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Gaussian summary tokens are introduced after the image tokens and before the question.

00:12.000 --> 00:22.500
Colours illustrate shared scene features. Summary tokens gather evidence across views.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.500
The image tokens, summary tokens and question form one sequence passing through the LLM.

00:30.500 --> 00:36.500
At layer 14, summary hidden states decode into a coarse Gaussian reconstruction of the room.

00:36.500 --> 00:39.500
The remaining LLM layers generate the answer.

00:39.500 --> 00:46.000
If the bed is behind you, what is in front of you? Sofa.
